---
// About.astro — segunda dobra. Apresenta o projeto e três pilares.
---
<section class="about" id="about" aria-label="About the multiverse">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">// The Multiverse</p>
    <h2>Original species, reimagined for the future of digital storytelling.</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Mondo Creatures is a creative laboratory where creature design and AI art
      collide. Every species in this universe begins as a single question:
      <em>what if?</em>
    </p>

    <ul class="pillars">
      <li>
        <span class="num">01</span>
        <h3>Original species</h3>
        <p>Each creature is designed from scratch — no recycled archetypes, no fan fiction. A dedicated lineage, ecology and silhouette.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="num">02</span>
        <h3>Cinematic motion</h3>
        <p>Vertical video first. Crafted with state-of-the-art AI pipelines and cinematic artistry, tuned for social-native attention spans.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="num">03</span>
        <h3>An expanding canon</h3>
        <p>Not a one-off drop. A growing universe with regions, ecosystems and unique species — released in chapters, like a slow-burn series.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 8rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg-2) 100%);
  }
  .container { max-width: var(--max-w); margin: 0 auto; }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  em { color: var(--fg); font-style: italic; }

  .pillars {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .pillars li {
    padding: 2.2rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    transition: background 0.3s ease;
  }
  .pillars li:hover { background: var(--bg-3); }

  .num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }
  .pillars h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .pillars p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
  }
</style>
